{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55668","headline":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 六十六 · 延寿","name":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 六十六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"得丧从来事甚均，任缘徒用苦劳神。\n野蔬随分堪充口，石室依稀可庇身。\n碧海几时无去棹，红衢何日息征轮。\n若教求道如求利，举世浑成无事人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"延寿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55668.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55668","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}